        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"f96ae53c-9e5c-4301-a068-aa0eaf7ab9bf\",\"review_text\":\"juxt a suggestion u guys should add amount of streams to every songs and amount of time I hav stream a song and a wrapp on a weekly basis 😪🙏🙏\"},{\"review_id\":\"49aec3f3-b820-4d66-9294-4fd34880104a\",\"review_text\":\"I don't why but my Spotify songs gets stop without any reason and when i try to resume the song app closes and it also doesn't show any playing song on the top also please fix this it is ruining songs and my mood also\"},{\"review_id\":\"9cde0f91-9dcc-4c09-a010-2ccd769dd10d\",\"review_text\":\"Love it 😀\"},{\"review_id\":\"02f392b0-59ac-4d8f-912e-4be35d307c7f\",\"review_text\":\"I like this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"7755eed9-6fd8-428b-b914-caa605d18d1a\",\"review_text\":\"Now it's full of money wrost app\"},{\"review_id\":\"9c19a4ef-7b9b-4d93-a3a9-89a84ed62ead\",\"review_text\":\"It's best option for when i want to listen to music .\"},{\"review_id\":\"11d34f82-b8eb-428e-8b3c-0e3ba3b4867a\",\"review_text\":\"Very 👍 👍 👍 👍 👍 👍\"},{\"review_id\":\"900e6a57-f1a9-4805-8aec-8f038a561d20\",\"review_text\":\"Best music app that I have come across\"},{\"review_id\":\"813d2ac6-c236-4702-ac22-c83e7dc913b8\",\"review_text\":\"I dont know if they did an update. But the app has been acting up lately. Deleted and installed and still having issues so i assume its the app itself.\"},{\"review_id\":\"0196e475-9e8d-4876-9d50-945cfce7ce51\",\"review_text\":\"Really wonderful\"}]}"
